tpm 1
boot power
# title-skip: power-on with blank cards. SW_ON's copyright and TIT_DEMO's whole story without
# input, so TITLE starts its logo animation from phase 0. Start at tick 300 (phase 4, the second
# build-up) skips to "press start" (phase 9); Start at tick 400 plays se 0 and exits to SELECT,
# which runs 5 ticks.
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
300 1 START
400 1 START
program SELECT
end 5
